# Claude Code 的 OAuth token：在宿主机上跑 `claude setup-token` 生成；agent 用你的 Claude 订阅，不用 API Key。
# Claude Code OAuth token: run `claude setup-token` on your host; lets the agent use your Claude subscription instead of an API key.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# 也可以改用 Anthropic API Key：去掉注释再填。
# Or use an Anthropic API key instead: uncomment and fill in.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GitHub 个人访问令牌：agent 用它读写 GitHub Issues。
# GitHub personal access token: the agent uses it to read and manage GitHub Issues.
# 建 fine-grained token / Create a fine-grained token: https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
# 仓库权限：Issues（读写）、Pull requests（只读）、Metadata（只读）
# Repository permissions: Issues (Read and write), Pull requests (Read), Metadata (Read)
GH_TOKEN=
# 别家模型的 API Key（.sandcastle/models.json 的档案里写 "${GLM_API_KEY}" 引用）；只有被阶段用到的档案才要求填。
# API keys for other vendors' models (profiles in .sandcastle/models.json reference them as "${GLM_API_KEY}"); only required when a phase uses that profile.
# sandcastle 只把这个文件里列出的变量带进容器。
# sandcastle only passes the variables listed in this file into the container.
GLM_API_KEY=
